title: What a subscription does not report
pid: 5d390cf5-dae5-4865-a721-64aec9d9cf94
body: |2-
  - edits to the subscribee's own title or body;
  - children the author removed (the fork still holds them);
  - reordering;
  - anything below the subscribee's children;
  - and the diff view shows no foreign change at all: foreign skgrepos are read at the worktree on both sides of the straddle ('docs/diff-view.org', "Foreign skgrepos").
